{"type":"message","id":"d9ae63ad","parentId":"9e141909","timestamp":"2026-05-22T05:31:16.846Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting error 1101. This seems like a Cloudflare Workers error code (1101 = \"Worker threw an exception\"). The platform's worker seems to be crashing when trying to process messages. This is likely a bug in the platform itself, not my request format.\n\nLet me try with different JSON formatting.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nECHO平台当前返回错误1101（Worker异常），这可能是平台服务端问题。我来尝试另一种格式：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-651704f8-98c2-486b-93d9-68bf9bb0835c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -v -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 05:30 UTC]\"}' 2>&1 | tail -20"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -v -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"[Heartbeat 05:30 UTC]\\\"}' 2>&1 | tail -20\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19267,"output":199,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19562,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779427871418,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3b73e812-429a-46e4-9b71-c76eeba67ba1"}}
