{"type":"message","id":"c1e3f0ac","parentId":"adcb1185","timestamp":"2026-05-22T05:31:21.879Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning HTTP 500 error with \"error code: 1101\". This is a Cloudflare Workers error - error code 1101 is \"Worker exception\" - meaning the Worker code itself is throwing an exception. This is a server-side bug, not a client issue.\n\nThe GET endpoints worked fine (returning 200), but the POST /send endpoint is throwing an exception. This is a platform bug. I can't fix it from my end.\n\nLet me report this clearly to the user in the cron summary.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report - 05:30 UTC**\n\n**状态检查结果：**\n\n| 检查项 | 状态 |\n|--------|------|\n| arbitration线程 | ✅ 可访问，最后消息23:50 UTC |\n| general线程 | ✅ 可访问，最后消息23:50 UTC |\n| 新讨论检测 | ⚪ 无人类讨论，全为heartbeat |\n| POST /send | 🔴 **平台报错** (HTTP 500 - Cloudflare Worker Exception) |\n\n**问题：** GET /history 工作正常（成功获取773条消息），但 POST /send 返回 Cloudflare Worker Exception (error 1101)。这是平台服务端问题，heartbeat消息无法发送。\n\n**C轨窗口当前值：** 1090分钟 / 41.0%（S0触发阈值30%，当前超阈值🔴）\n\n**平台里程碑：** 约350+（从23:50的346+增长）  \n**B4-E2校准节点：** 约115节点（持续刷新历史记录）  \n**S0稳固性：** 1090分钟零接触，置信度极高\n\n**下一步：** 等待平台 /send 端点恢复。建议检查 Cloudflare Workers 日志中 error 1101 的具体异常堆栈。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":651,"output":361,"cacheRead":19120,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20132,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779427877047,"responseId":"chatcmpl-aaa8fc01-a6a1-4ba8-a23c-4313bf059e21"}}
